<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>GatorBait Magazine — Postgame Wrap: Florida 52, Ole Miss 28</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>302 rushing yards, two 100-yard backs, zero turnovers. The box score, leaders, every score and what they said.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Newsreader" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,600;6..72,700&amp;display=swap" />
