        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Cover -->
    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_cf3c6da48f1a41e48eea9484d677f784~mv2.jpg"
          alt="The Ben Hill Griffin Stadium scoreboard shows the 52-28 final as Florida celebrates. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media."
          width="400px" align="center" padding="0" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="24px 30px 28px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#FA7A45" font-size="10px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.9px" padding="0 0 8px">
          FINAL · POSTGAME WRAP
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 0 10px">
          <span class="gb-h1">FINAL: Florida 52, No. 4 Ole Miss 28</span>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#D5DFEC" font-size="16px" line-height="1.55" padding="0 0 15px">
          Two 100-yard backs, 302 rushing yards, zero turnovers, and five straight second-half touchdown drives. Florida is 4-0 (2-0 SEC).
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#9EADC1" font-size="10px" padding="0 0 14px">
          The final in The Swamp · Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/florida-ole-miss-final-baugh-gators-run-over-rebels?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_wrap_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=cover_game_story" align="left" padding="0">
          READ THE GAME STORY →
        </mj-button>
